+### Formulas
+*   **Sign Function**: $sign(d) = \begin{cases} 1 & \text{if } d > \theta \\ -1 & \text{otherwise} \end{cases}$
+*   **Fine Mesh Iso-point Parameter**: $t_{fine} = \frac{\theta - d(p_{div})}{d(v) - d(p_{div})}$
+*   **Coarse Mesh Iso-point Parameter**: $t_{coarse} = \frac{\theta - \bar{d}}{d(v) - \bar{d}}$, where $\bar{d} = \frac{d(p_{div}) + d(v)}{2}$
+*   **Physical Distance**: $E = |t_{fine} - t_{coarse}| \cdot \| \vec{v} - \vec{p}_{div} \|$
+*   **Approximation Error**: $E_{max} = \max_{i=1..4} (E_i)$
 
